***October 28*** Integrity now uses my updated [*Stranger Quarkdown*](https://github.com/Sup2point0/stranger-quarkdown) framework for compiling Markdown, which also meant significant internal restructing. Hopefully nothing broke!

***August 22*** Integrity now uses my [*Desmost*](https://github.com/Sup2point0/desmost) compiler for Desmos, meaning richer, faster and more reliable Desmos embeds!

***July 16*** A whole host of behind-the-scene fixes should mean your experience on *Integrity* is even smoother ;)
